What this repository actually contributes
-----------------------------------------
Not new algorithms, but: a three-layer framing, a set of verified failure
symptom tables, measured calibration data for one specific slider, and an
honest account of what did NOT work. The upstream projects below provided
the core methods; the measured numbers, the failure cases and the
"跟到底验证到哪" sections are local work.

